        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "The course page has become a valuable link to the class, and a resource for the students. I am very optimistic about the potential for graphics with sound. The bandwidth for voiceover is low, and FlashPlayer is freely available. This offers a quick review (with active experiment), and the full lectures can be downloaded. I hope professors and students worldwide will find these web pages helpful. My goal is to make this book as useful as possible with all the course material I can provide.",
